   00335| // An `exclude` phrase names a sense of the trigger word that is not this
   00336| // operation ("smallest first" orders a list; it does not ask for the minimum).
   00337| // Mirrors OperationTrigger::matches in src/seed/operation_vocabulary.rs.
   00338| function operationFormMatches(normalized, operation) {
