   00770| // form.slot ("bare" / "prefix" / "suffix" / "circumfix") to derive its
   00771| // affix-matching strategy from the data. Mirrors Lexicon::role_word_forms in
   00772| // src/seed/meanings.rs (issue #386).
   00773| function roleWordForms(role) {
